Spring Boot 3.4 and newer including 4.x. Environment mode comes from DEPLOY_ENV only (`production` is the one production value); Spring reads it from the OS environment at run time, nothing is inlined at build time. Set SITE_URL (for example https://example.com, no trailing slash). The robots/sitemap controller must be reachable by crawlers (permitAll in the security config); delete any static src/main/resources/static/robots.txt or sitemap.xml so the controller is the only source. Replace `PUBLIC_PATHS` with the indexable public pages (200, canonical, not noindex), in the same canonical form as your <link rel="canonical"> tags; above 50,000 URLs or 50 MB split into a sitemap index.
